+# lanes: codex           Codex CLI, unsandboxed
+#        kimi            Kimi Code under sandbox/agent.sb (no reading or writing the real home), scratch HOME
+#        codex-sandboxed Codex CLI executed inside sandbox/agent.sb (isolated HOME), with output written to a temporary location and copied back after the sandbox exits
 set -u
